Z||000011||squid||01-13-2001||09:01 PM||||Multiport injected Caddy engines have different valve covers than TBI engines due to injector clearance. They cant be interchanged unless you swap the intake too. <p>[This message has been edited by squid (edited 01-13-2001).]||||reg||1
