Z||000014||Will||01-14-2001||12:54 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by bubbajoexx:<BR> <BR>Thanks for the tip my site will show the complete installation including the wiring change overs . Preparing to install a 4.9 with the 4.5 fuel system TBI instead of the MPI Injection <P>And it is stick with 410 gears<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR>I only run the swap with TBI setup for all the engines<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Why? Wiring difficulties? It doesn't make much sense to me to short change yourself on the electronics after going to all the trouble of doing the swap.||||reg||1
Z||000015||rockcrawl||01-14-2001||08:42 AM||||I agree with Will, I was also wodering why you didn't use the MPI. Efficiency in fuel injection is like free hp. The wiring is just as easy as the TBI. The only major change would be the fuel pump and high pressure hoses. The MPI starts easier and runs smoother. If there is a major drawback, I'd like to hear it.<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rockcrawlsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000016||bubbajoexx||01-14-2001||09:59 AM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by rockcrawl:<BR>[B]I agree with Will, I was also wodering why you didn't use the MPI. Efficiency in fuel injection is like free hp. The wiring is just as easy as the TBI. The only major change would be the fuel pump and high pressure hoses. The MPI starts easier and runs smoother. If there is a major drawback, I'd like to hear it.<P>for 2 reasons  one the simplicity of instalation for the average person <BR>two sfi on 91 to 94 caddys do not like the removal of the BSE computer and constantly set false codes and put the computer in default mode. (BSE is the body computer in the caddy which tranmits data back and forth between the body and engine computers) with out the BSE the computer is in defaul mode even though the engine runs fine you will not get all the power it poduces when in default mode .<P>||||reg||1
